// REST→gRPC dispatch: translates incoming JSON HTTP requests into typed gRPC calls.
//
// This module maps each registry route's grpc_path to the appropriate tonic client
// method, deserializing JSON request bodies and serializing protobuf responses back
// to JSON. This should eventually be generated by tacplus.

